5,1,1,talk,Servas,,The old three-person split feels heavy now. We must find a rhythm that honors everyone's presence.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry the current method creates silent tension. Let’s look for a way that preserves our peace.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious if the numbers actually match our daily lives. I want to see the truth.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
