18,1,3,talk,May,,I will also look at the winter habits. I need to know the seasonal spike.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will also look at the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
