35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The numbers show a wild swing. February is nearly three times August. We must plan for the cold.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,I saw how long the other house takes. Forty minutes of arguing over meters. I do not want that here.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The monitors show one room uses four times more. It is not just about people, but habits.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The quote is 34,000 yen per room. That is a lot of upfront cash. I need to see if it saves me later.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The template took me three hours to fill out. I cannot do that every month. It is too much.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, the disparity is real. But does it mean we should punish the warm rooms?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I understand the burden. I think we need a method that is almost invisible.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I do not want to punish anyone. I just want the share to match the use.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"The winter habits show people ignore the cost. If we do not see the number, we waste it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"If I have to chase people for money, I will break. I need a system that runs itself.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,The sunlight data is clear. Two rooms need heat early. We must acknowledge that difference.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,I think the other house's method is too rigid. It creates friction. We need something softer.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The statements show the total changes so much. A fixed split is definitely wrong.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"I am leaning towards the meters. The upfront cost is high, but the predictability is worth it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"The payment log shows the delays come from confusion. If the math is clear, the delays stop.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,We have the data. Now we must choose a path that keeps our hearts open.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I am ready to vote. I want the option that keeps us talking, not fighting.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am ready. I trust the data will lead us to the fairest place.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I am ready. I need to know my number is stable before I sign anything.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am ready. I just need to know I will not be the one doing the math.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
